<title>FRANCE: Promodes first-half profit up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Promodes first-half profit up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     317  vs	     288</p>
<p>    Net consolidated			     383  vs	     365</p>
<p>    Turnover				    49,383  vs	  47,522</p>
<p>    Operating					807  vs	     876</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   825  vs	     724</p>
<p>NOTE - French retailer Promodes said in a statement the sale of its German unit Promohypermarkt would generate in its second half consolidated accounts a capital loss of around 100 million francs</p>
</text>
